msgctxt "224"
msgid "You're back again? What's going on this time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"I went and talked to a lawyer about filing for bankruptcy, but he said I "
"can't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "He told me to work harder instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "What do you mean, you can't file for bankruptcy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"He said because I used the loans on gambling and entertainment, I can't "
"declare bankruptcy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Then he told me to stop messing around and take responsibility... I "
"deserved that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"I went to the loan sharks and told them I'd do all I could to pay off my "
"loans, but they got mad at me. \"Of course you will, jackass!\" I deserved "
"that, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Then they dragged me into their office and ran down the list of things I "
"could do to pay them back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Work the rest of my life on some island... Sell some of my organs..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "I got scared and ran the hell out of there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"But I know those guys are gonna be after me, no matter how fast or far I "
"run..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "So you came back to the river and decided to kill yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Yeah... I don't know what else I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"I told you before, dying won't help you. You took out those loans. It's up "
"to you to find a way to pay them back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "I'm sure you're right, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Oh! That's it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"I heard something about consolidating a bunch of different loans into one "
"and how that might help me with my situation..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "What do you think? Should I try that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"If it sounds too good to be true, it probably is. Guys like you are easy "
"marks for scam artists."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "So you think those offers are scams?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "I can't say for sure, but you have to watch out for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"If that's what you think, Kiryu-san, then I'll have to think this all over "
"more carefully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"That's a good idea. Remember, they're your loans. You've got to take "
"responsibility for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Ugh... You sound just like my dad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"At least it's something. Remember, they're your loans. You've got to take "
"responsibility for them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Ugh... You sound just like my dad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "Well, thank you for talking to me again. I really appreciate it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "You make me feel like I can get through this somehow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Here, Kiryu-san. I'd like you to have this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Royale<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "I'm going to try harder from now on. Thanks again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Watch out, could be a scam."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "At least it's something."
msgstr ""

